  - Added the narrow public, read-only, fail-closed `AuthorizationLedger.authenticate_window` query. This was the only unavoidable file-scope expansion: it avoids coupling the trusted builder to the private journal `_read_records` implementation and does not mutate authority.
- `tests/test_agent_loop.py`
  - Added route/config, phase-first dispatch, canary ordering, prepare-line, summary, policy-worker argv/environment, and cleanup classification coverage.
- `tests/test_pit_optimizer_v2.py`
