### C1: one authenticated discovery-evidence identity

The end-to-end identity is now the full authenticated `ParityFoldEvidence.evidence_sha256`. `FoldEvaluationResult` requires that digest, the production evaluator carries it through discovery, the controller promotes those exact fold digests into `DiscoveryEvidenceSummary.evidence_ids`, and `_finish_discovery` compares the repeated full-evidence digest with the promoted full-evidence digest. The old aggregate-projection digest is no longer manufactured during incumbent promotion.

